<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore government awards three property sites.</title>
<headline>Singapore government awards three property sites.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore government has awarded three residential sites in the eastern part of the island to the highest bidders in a recent tender, the Urban Redevelopment Authority (URA) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Windew Investment Pte Ltd, which is part of Wing Tai Holdings, has been awarded a 24,922.69 sq m site at Tanah Merah Kechil Road for S$28.89 million.</p>
<p>Riverside Investments Pte Ltd, a company linked to Centrepoint Properties Lte, has been awarded a 35,366.74 sq m site at Bedok Walk for S$53.10 million.</p>
<p>First Capital Corp won a 23,586 sq m site at Tanjong Rhu Road for S$203.75 million.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
